<form id="signup-form">

    <input id="user-name" type="text"
           name="username" class="form-control">

    <input id="email" type="email"
           name="email" class="form-control">

    <button type="submit"
            class="btn btn-primary">
        Signup
    </button>

    <ul id="skills">
        <li>Python</li>
        <li>Selenium</li>
        <li>Playwright</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="error-message">
        Invalid email
    </div>

</form>

Descendant A B= form input -> Locate all elements or not? or first matching element

Direct child A > B = ui > li -> Locate all the elements having li 

Next adjacent sibling A + B = h2 + p

followinf sibling -> A ~ B 

:first-child
:nth-child(2)
:last-child
:not(x) -> exclude matching elements
:has(x) -> parent containing descendant

